            "A cold reptile covered in scales with a flat wedge head.",
            "A soft-bodied insect with a chitin shell and six thin legs.",
            "A slimy amphibian with moist smooth skin and webbed feet.",
            "A hoofed grazing animal with a long neck and narrow snout.",
            "A shelled mollusk with tentacles and no skeleton at all.",
            "A furred rodent with whiskers, small ears, and sharp teeth.",
        ],
    },
    "bipedal": {
        "rol": "V9 — Alt ekstremite: iki ayak üstünde dik duruş",
        "pozitif": [
            "It stands upright on two legs with its spine held vertical.",
            "A creature that walks on two feet in an erect posture.",
            "It balances on two hind legs, standing tall and upright.",
            "A bipedal being that strides forward on two sturdy legs.",
            "It carries itself vertically, weight resting on two feet.",
            "A two-legged creature whose torso rises above its hips.",
            "It walks erect on a pair of legs, hands free of the ground.",
            "A creature with an upright bipedal gait on two strong feet.",
        ],
        "negatif": [
            "It crawls on its belly, dragging its body along the ground.",
            "A creature that moves on four legs with its back horizontal.",
            "It slithers low across the earth with no legs at all.",
            "A quadruped whose four limbs all touch the ground while moving.",
            "It scuttles sideways on many jointed legs close to the soil.",
            "A creature that swims, propelling itself with a flattened tail.",
